request_description:
• The amount of energy crop planted in Ireland from 2007-2016, broken down by year and amount planted per crop (in Hectares);
• Projections for the amount of energy crop to be planted in Ireland in 2017, broken down by year and amount planted per crop (in Hectares);
• The number of applications under the Bio-Energy Establishment Scheme from 2007-Present, broken down by year and energy crop;
• A copy of all documents (reports, including drafts, memos, meeting minutes, emails, etc...) concerning Bord na Mona's input into the drafting of the Bio-Energy (Willow) Scheme 2015

Project ID: 15 S 722; 
Title: Strategies for Predicting, Evaluating, Recording and Monitoring of Bull FERTility. 
Under freedom of information I am requesting the unedited written Evaluation Report and Scores from the ‘Expert Evaluation Panel’ on the above project.
